      "question_id": "Q1",
      "question": "What event or signal starts the review — for example, does the engineer receive an automated notification, a manual assignment in a task system, or an email — and where does the specification document come from at that moment?",
      "answer": "The reviewer collects the specification document along with a related feature change list from a document repository. The exact trigger signal — whether automated notification, manual assignment, or email — is not specified in what I know."
    },
    {
      "question_id": "Q2",
      "question": "What specific criteria or checklist does the engineer use to decide whether a new feature is correctly reflected in the document?",
      "answer": "The reviewer compares the feature change list against the document content to check that all feature changes are reflected. A review checklist is also used. The specific checklist items or criteria beyond feature coverage and terminology consistency are not specified."
    },
    {
      "question_id": "Q3",
      "question": "Can you walk me through the sequence of individual steps the engineer performs during the review, from opening the document to completing it?",
      "answer": "The reviewer first collects the specification document and feature change list. Next, they compare feature changes with the document content. Then they check terminology and formatting consistency. Finally, they record comments and requested revisions. Those steps complete the reviewer's portion of the process."
    },
    {
      "question_id": "Q4",
      "question": "What are the possible outcomes at the end of the review, and what action or next step does each outcome trigger?",
      "answer": "I am not sure about that."
    },
    {
      "question_id": "Q5",
      "question": "Which tools or systems does the engineer use during the review, and in what file format is the specification document typically stored?",
      "answer": "I am not sure about that."
    },
    {
      "question_id": "Q6",
      "question": "After the engineer completes the review, who receives the document or the review findings, and does any other role participate in the process before or after the engineer's review?",
      "answer": "I am not sure about that."
    }
  ]
}
